[0.016207, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[G\r\n\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m⏺\u001b[39m Perfect! I was able to retrieve vu_vu's current queue from the StreamerSongList API. Here's what I found:\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1mvu_vu's Current Queue\u001b[22m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1mTotal songs in queue:\u001b[22m 5 songs\r\n\r\n  \u001b[2mQueue Details:\u001b[22m\r\n\r\n  1. \u001b[1mPosition 1:\u001b[22m \"NOT A REAL SONG\" by KEKYou (added June 12, 2023)\r\n  2. \u001b[1mPosition 2:\u001b[22m \"NOT A REAL SONG\" by KEKYou (added June 12, 2023)\r\n  3. \u001b[1mPosition 3:\u001b[22m \"NOT A REAL SONG\" by KEKYou (added June 12, 2023)\r\n  4. \u001b[1mPosition 4:\u001b[22m \"NOT A REAL SONG\" by KEKYou (added June 12, 2023)\r\n  5. \u001b[1mPosition 5:\u001b[22m \"Baka Mitai\" by Yakuza OST (added October 11, 2025) - \u001b[3mRecently requested by vu_vu\u001b[23m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[2mAdditional Info:\u001b[22m\r\n\r\n  - \u001b[1mSongs played today:\u001b[22m 0\r\n  - \u001b[1mMost recent activity:\u001b[22m \"Baka Mitai\" was requested by vu_vu and is currently in chat\r\n\r\n  \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m★ Insight ───────────────────────"]
[0.000024, "o", "──────────────\u001b[39m\r\n  The API shows that most of the queue appears to be filled with placeholder/test songs (\"NOT A REAL SONG\" by\r\n  KEKYou) from June 2023, with only one recent legitimate song request. This suggests the streamer may have\r\n  been testing their system or these are old queued items that haven't been cleared.\r\n  \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m─────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n  The queue data shows that vu_vu has 5 songs currently queued, with the most recent being \"Baka Mitai\" from\r\n  the Yakuza soundtrack, which was actively requested and is currently being highlighted in the chat.\r\n\r\n\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m✳\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;215;119;87mTempering… \u001b[39m\u001b[2m(esc to interrupt · 11s · ↓\u001b[22m \u001b[2m856 tokens)\u001b[22m\r\n\r\n\u001b[2m\u001b[38;2;136;136;136m──────────────────────────────────────────"]
